---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="NetSuite Services | Inscio">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="bg-[#0D1235] text-white py-24 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center">
      <div class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white text-sm font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-full mb-6 uppercase tracking-widest">
        Our Services
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold leading-tight mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        NetSuite Services Built Around Your Business
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-blue-200 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
        From initial implementation to long-term optimization, Inscio provides the expertise and support you need to get the most from NetSuite.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-white text-[#0D1235] font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded-lg text-lg hover:bg-blue-50 transition-colors">
        Talk to an Expert
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services Grid -->
  <section class="py-20 px-6 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#0D1235] mb-4">What We Do</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Every engagement is tailored to where you are today and where you want to go.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10">

        <!-- Implementation -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-10 shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-blue-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0D1235] mb-4">NetSuite Implementation</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
            We deploy NetSuite the right way — configuring the system to match your actual workflows, not the other way around. Our structured methodology minimizes risk and gets you to go-live faster without sacrificing quality.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-600">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> Business process discovery and mapping</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> System configuration and customization</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> Data migration from legacy systems</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> Integration with third-party tools</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> User training and change management</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> Go-live support and hypercare</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Managed Services -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-10 shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-blue-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0D1235] mb-4">Managed Services & Support</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
            After go-live, your needs don't stop. Inscio provides ongoing managed services so your team always has access to expert NetSuite support — without the overhead of a full-time internal admin.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-600">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> Dedicated support team, not a help desk ticket queue</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> System enhancements and new module rollouts</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> User training for new hires and teams</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> Monthly system health reviews</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> Release management and upgrade guidance</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> Proactive optimization recommendations</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Optimization -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-10 shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-blue-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0D1235] mb-4">NetSuite Optimization</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
            Already on NetSuite but not getting the most from it? We audit your current setup, identify gaps, and implement improvements that drive real business value — faster processes, better reporting, and fewer manual workarounds.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-600">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> NetSuite health assessment and audit</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> Workflow automation and SuiteFlow builds</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> Custom reporting and saved searches</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> SuiteScript customizations</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> Dashboard and KPI setup</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> Role and permission restructuring</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Integrations -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-10 shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-blue-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 9l3 3-3 3m5 0h3M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0D1235] mb-4">Integrations & Customization</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
            NetSuite works best when it's connected to the rest of your tech stack. We design and build integrations that automate data flows, eliminate manual entry, and give you a single source of truth across your business.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-600">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> REST and SOAP web services integrations</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> EDI and supply chain connectivity</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> eCommerce platform integrations (Shopify, Magento)</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> CRM and marketing tool connections</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> Custom SuiteScript development</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-blue-600 mt-1">✓</span> iPaaS and middleware solutions (Celigo, Boomi)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Process Section -->
  <section class="py-20 px-6 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#0D1235] mb-4">Our Approach</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Every engagement follows a clear process — so you always know where things stand and what comes next.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-[#0D1235] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-2xl font-extrabold mx-auto mb-4">1</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0D1235] mb-2">Discover</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">We learn your business — your processes, your pain points, your goals — before we write a single line of configuration.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-[#0D1235] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-2xl font-extrabold mx-auto mb-4">2</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0D1235] mb-2">Design</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">We document the solution design and get your sign-off before building. No surprises at go-live.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-[#0D1235] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-2xl font-extrabold mx-auto mb-4">3</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0D1235] mb-2">Build & Test</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">We configure, build, and test thoroughly in a sandbox environment — with your team involved at key milestones.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-[#0D1235] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-2xl font-extrabold mx-auto mb-4">4</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0D1235] mb-2">Launch & Grow</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">We go live together and stay close post-launch — then help you grow into the platform as your business evolves.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section class="bg-[#0D1235] text-white py-20 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Not Sure Where to Start?</h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-blue-200 mb-10">
        We'll help you figure it out. A 30-minute call is all it takes to understand your situation and point you in the right direction — with no pressure and no sales pitch.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-white text-[#0D1235] font-bold px-10 py-4 rounded-lg text-lg hover:bg-blue-50 transition-colors">
        Book a Free Strategy Call
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
